      "name": "dsh-edit-message",
      "title": {
        "en": "Edit and resend",
        "zh": "编辑并重发"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A pencil on each of your own messages: edit it and resend on a new branch, even while the agent is still replying. The running turn stops first and the replaced conversation is archived, not deleted. After installing from Discover, turn it on under Installed.",
        "zh": "在你自己的消息上加一支铅笔：改写后在新分支重发，回复过程中也能改（会先停止当前回复），被替换的原对话归档不删除。从「发现」安装后，在「已安装」里打开开关才会生效。"
      },
